A = {
120: """Hello, is this the clothing store on Hoang Van Thu Street? My name is Minh. I bought a jacket at your store about an hour ago, and I just realized that I left my wallet behind, probably on the counter when I was paying. It's a small black leather wallet, and it has my ID card, my driver's license, two bank cards, and some cash inside. I'm really worried, because I need my ID card for work tomorrow. Could you please check if someone found it? I have a few suggestions. If you found it, I can come back to the store right now to pick it up. If I can't make it before you close, could you keep it safe until tomorrow morning? Or, if it's more convenient, I could send a delivery driver to collect it. Please call me back at this number. Thank you so much.""",
121: """Yes, I once left my phone at a restaurant, and it was really stressful. It happened about two years ago. I went out for dinner with some coworkers at a hot pot restaurant after work. We had a great time, and after paying, we all left in a hurry because it was raining. When I got home about thirty minutes later, I reached into my pocket and realized my phone wasn't there. I panicked, because all my work contacts and my banking apps were on it. I borrowed my wife's phone and called my number, but nobody answered. So I immediately drove back to the restaurant in the rain. Luckily, a waiter had found my phone under our table and kept it at the counter. I was so relieved that I gave him a small tip to thank him. Since then, I always check my table before I leave.""",
122: """Hi Hoa, it's Minh. How are you? Last week you told me about a food store you go to, the one that sells organic vegetables, right? My wife and I want to eat healthier, so I'd like to know more about it. First, where exactly is it? Is it far from the city center? Second, what kinds of products do they sell? Is it only vegetables, or do they also have meat, fish, and fruit? Third, how are the prices? Is it much more expensive than the supermarket? Also, do they have a delivery service or an app for online orders? That would be really convenient for us, because we're busy on weekdays. And finally, what time do they open and close? I'd like to go there this weekend. Please call me back when you get this message. Thanks a lot.""",
123: """Hello, is this the Green Market store? My name is Minh. I was shopping at your store about thirty minutes ago, and I paid for two bags of groceries at the counter. But when I got home, I realized I only had one bag with me. I think I left the other bag near the checkout. It has some meat, eggs, milk, and vegetables in it, so I'm a bit worried, because some of the food needs to be kept cold. I have a few solutions in mind. First, could you please check if the bag is still there and put it in your fridge for now? I can come back to pick it up in about an hour. If that's not possible, could you deliver it to my house? I'm happy to pay the delivery fee. My receipt number is on my phone if you need it. Thank you so much.""",
124: """There's a food store I go to quite often, which is a small organic store near my apartment. I first found it about a year ago, when my coworker recommended it to me. She said the vegetables there were fresh and safe, without chemicals. At that time, my wife and I were worried about food safety, because there had been some news about vegetables with too many pesticides. So we decided to try it. What's special about this store is that most of the products come directly from farms near my city, and they have information about where each product comes from. They offer fresh vegetables, fruit, eggs, and meat, and also things like rice, honey, and homemade sauces. The prices are a bit higher than at the market, but the quality is great. The staff are very friendly, and they even remember what my daughter likes.""",
125: """Hello, is this Sun Travel Agency? I'm planning a trip to Da Nang with my family next month, and I'd like to ask a few questions about your tour packages. There will be three of us, two adults and a five-year-old girl. First, how many days is the tour, and what places will we visit? I'd love to go to Ba Na Hills and Hoi An if possible. Second, what's included in the price? Does it include flights, hotel, meals, and entrance tickets? Third, what kind of hotel will we stay in? Is it near the beach, and does it have a swimming pool for kids? Also, do you have any discounts for children or for families? And finally, what's your cancellation policy, in case something comes up and we can't go? Could you send me the details by email? Thank you very much.""",
126: """Hello, this is Minh. I booked a flight to Da Nang through your agency last month for next Friday. Unfortunately, something came up. My father just had surgery, and I need to stay home and take care of him for a few weeks, so I can't travel next week. I know the ticket is non-refundable, but I'd like to discuss a few possible solutions. First, would it be possible to change the date of my flight to next month? I'm happy to pay a change fee if needed. Second, if changing the date isn't possible, could I transfer the ticket to my brother instead? He could use it for the same trip. Or third, if neither of those options works, could I get a credit or voucher that I can use for a future booking? Please let me know what you think. Thank you for your help.""",
127: """Something really unusual happened to me during a trip to Hoi An about three years ago. I went there with my wife for a short vacation. On the second evening, we were walking around the old town, which was beautiful with all the lanterns. Suddenly, it started raining heavily, and within an hour, the streets near the river were flooded. The water came up to our knees. We had never seen anything like that before. At first, we were scared, but then we noticed that the local people were very calm. Some shop owners even invited us inside their shops to wait until the rain stopped. Then a local man offered to take us back to our hotel in his small boat, right through the flooded streets. It was such a strange and amazing experience. We still laugh about the night we took a boat taxi in the middle of a town.""",
128: """Hi Jenny, it's Minh. How are you? I've got great news. My wife and I are planning to visit you in Korea next month. Before we go, I'd like to ask you a few questions about the geography there. First, are there many mountains near Seoul? I've heard hiking is really popular in Korea, and I'd love to try it. Second, are there any beautiful beaches or islands that are easy to reach from the city? Also, what's the weather like there next month? Is it already cold? Then, I have a few questions about our travel plans. Which areas of Seoul do you recommend for a hotel? Is it easy to travel around by subway? And would you have time to show us around on the weekend? Please call me back when you're free. I can't wait to see you.""",
129: """Hi Jenny, it's Minh again. I'm really sorry, but I have some bad news. I can't come to Korea next month as we planned. My company just told me that I have to go on an important business trip to Ho Chi Minh City during the same week, and I can't change it. My wife and I are really disappointed, because we were looking forward to seeing you. I have a few ideas. First, maybe we could postpone our trip until December. I'll be free then, and we could see the snow, which would be amazing. Second, if December doesn't work for you, maybe we could go in the spring, during cherry blossom season. Or, if you have time, you could visit us in Vietnam instead, and we would show you around Hanoi. Please let me know what you think. Again, I'm really sorry.""",
130: """Yes, I've been to Korea once, about two years ago, with my wife. The geography there was quite different from Vietnam. First of all, there are mountains almost everywhere, even inside cities. In Seoul, you can see mountains from many places, and people can go hiking right after work. In Vietnam, our mountains are mainly in the north, far from big cities like Hanoi. Second, Korea has four very clear seasons. I went in autumn, and the trees on the mountains were red and yellow, which was beautiful. In Vietnam, especially in the south, the weather is warm all year, and the leaves don't really change color. Third, Korea is a peninsula, so it has sea on three sides, while Vietnam has a long coastline on just one side. Both countries have beautiful nature, but in different ways.""",
131: """Good evening. I just arrived in the city, and I'm looking for a room for tonight. Do you have any rooms available? I'd like a double room for one night, preferably a quiet room on a high floor, with a big window and a city view. I'd also prefer a non-smoking room. First, how much is the room per night? Does that price include breakfast? Second, what time is check-out tomorrow? My bus leaves in the afternoon, so I'm wondering if I could check out a little later, maybe at two o'clock. Third, do you have Wi-Fi in the room, and is it free? I need to do some work tonight. And finally, is there a good restaurant near the hotel where I can have dinner? I'd like to try some local food. Thank you very much for your help.""",
132: """Hi everyone, it's Minh. I'm calling to let you know about a problem. I just talked to the receptionist at the hotel we wanted to stay at, and unfortunately, they're fully booked tonight because there's a big festival in the city this weekend. So we don't have a place to stay yet. Don't worry, though. I have a few ideas. First, the receptionist told me about another hotel about ten minutes away, and it still has some rooms. It's a bit more expensive, but it looks nice and clean. Second, we could look for a homestay on a booking app. They're usually cheaper and closer to the old town. Or third, if we can't find anything good, we could take a bus to the next town, which is only an hour away. Let me know which option you prefer. Please call me back as soon as you get this.""",
133: """I remember a time when my travel plans didn't work out at all. About three years ago, my friends and I planned a trip to Ha Giang, a mountainous province in the far north. We were going to rent motorbikes and ride around the mountains for three days. But on the morning we arrived, there was heavy rain, and the local people told us there had been landslides on some of the mountain roads, so it was too dangerous to ride. We were really disappointed. At first, we didn't know what to do. Then we discussed it together and decided to change our plan. Instead of riding far, we stayed in the town for one more day and visited some local villages and markets nearby. When the roads were safe again, we did a shorter route. In the end, it was still a great trip, just different from what we planned.""",
134: """Hello, is this the Seaside Hotel? My name is Minh, and I have a reservation at your hotel for next week. I'm calling because I'd like to know what the weather is like there right now. Is it hot or cool? Does it rain a lot this time of year? I want to know what kind of clothes I should bring. Should I bring a jacket, or are T-shirts and shorts enough? Also, I have a few more questions about my trip. Is the hotel close to the beach? Can you walk there easily? Second, do you have a shuttle bus from the airport to the hotel? And how much does it cost? Finally, are there any good tours you can recommend, like a boat trip or a city tour? I'm traveling with my wife and daughter, so something family-friendly would be great. Thank you so much.""",
135: """Hello, is this the clothing store near the city center? I'm a tourist here, and I have a problem. I only brought summer clothes for my vacation, like T-shirts and shorts, because I thought the weather would be warm. But it's actually much colder than I expected, especially in the evenings, and it's quite windy. My wife and daughter are also cold. So we need to buy some warmer clothes as soon as possible. Could I ask you a few questions? First, do you have jackets or sweaters for adults and children? My daughter is five years old. Second, what's the price range? We don't want anything too expensive, because we only need them for a few days. Also, are there any discounts at the moment? And finally, how late are you open today, and what's the best way to get to your store from the beach? Thank you.""",
136: """Yes, I had trouble with unexpected weather during a camping trip about two years ago. My friends and I planned to camp by a lake near my city for one night. The weather forecast said it would be sunny, so we didn't bring any raincoats. In the afternoon, we set up our tents and started a barbecue. Everything was perfect. But around eight o'clock, the sky suddenly turned dark, and a huge storm came. The wind was so strong that one of our tents almost blew away, and heavy rain poured down. We were completely soaked within a few minutes. We quickly packed up everything we could and ran to our cars. Since it was too dangerous to stay, we decided to drive home in the middle of the night. It was a disaster at the time, but now we laugh about it. Since then, I always bring a raincoat.""",
137: """Hello, is this the Grand Hotel in Seoul? I'm planning a business trip to Seoul next month, and I'm interested in staying at your hotel for four nights. Could I ask you a few questions? First, do you have a single room available from the tenth to the fourteenth? And how much is it per night? Second, does the room have a desk and fast internet? I'll need to work in the evenings and have some online meetings. Third, do you have a business center or a meeting room I could book? I might need to meet with some clients at the hotel. Also, how far is the hotel from the Gangnam area? My client's office is there, so I'd like to know if it's easy to get there by subway or taxi. And finally, does the price include breakfast? Thank you very much for your help.""",
138: """Hello, Mr. Park, it's Minh. I'm so sorry to call you so late, but something came up, and I won't be able to join you on the business trip to Korea next week. My daughter was just taken to the hospital with a high fever, and the doctor said she needs to stay there for a few days, so I need to be with her. I know this trip is very important, so I'd like to suggest a few things to help. First, I could join the meetings online by video call. I've already prepared the presentation, so I could still present our part. Second, my coworker Lan knows this project very well, and she could go with you instead of me. I can brief her tomorrow. And third, after you come back, I can contact the client directly to follow up. Again, I'm really sorry. Please let me know what you think.""",
139: """Yes, I had a problem during a business trip to Ho Chi Minh City last year. I flew there for a three-day training course. When I arrived at the airport, I waited at the baggage area for a long time, but my suitcase never came out. I went to the lost baggage counter, and they told me that my suitcase had been sent to Da Nang by mistake. The problem was that all my clothes, my laptop charger, and my training documents were inside, and the course started the next morning. I was really stressed. First, I filled out a form, and the airline promised to send the suitcase to my hotel. Then I went to a shopping mall that evening and bought a shirt, some basic things, and a charger. Luckily, my suitcase arrived at the hotel the next evening, so I only had to survive one day without it.""",
140: """Excuse me, could you help me, please? I really like this wooden desk, and I'm thinking of buying it for my home office. Could I ask you a few questions? First, what is it made of? Is it real wood? And how big is it exactly? I need to make sure it fits next to the window in my bedroom. Second, does it come in any other colors? I'm looking for something a bit lighter to match my other furniture. Third, how much is it, and are there any promotions right now? Also, do you deliver, and is delivery free? Does the price include assembly, or do I have to put it together myself? And finally, what's the warranty for this desk? If anything is broken, can I return it or exchange it? Thank you very much.""",
141: """Hello, my name is Minh. I bought a wooden desk from your store last week, and it was delivered to my house this morning. Unfortunately, there's a serious problem with it. When I unpacked it, I found that one of the legs was cracked, and there's a big scratch across the top. I can't use it like this, because it's not stable and it could be dangerous for my daughter. I'd like to suggest a few solutions. First, could you send me a new desk of the same model as soon as possible and take the broken one back? Second, if you don't have the same model in stock, I'd be happy to exchange it for a similar desk. Or third, if neither of those is possible, I'd like a full refund. I've taken some photos of the damage, and I can send them to you. Please call me back. Thank you.""",
142: """Yes, I had a problem when I bought a sofa about two years ago. We had just moved into our apartment, and we ordered a gray fabric sofa from a furniture store. When it was delivered, the delivery men carried it into the living room and left quickly. After they left, I noticed that the color was much darker than the one I saw in the store, and one of the cushions had a small hole. I was really disappointed. I called the store right away and explained the problem. At first, the staff said the color looked different because of the lights in the store. But when I sent them photos and my order number, they checked and realized they had delivered the wrong model. They apologized and replaced it with the correct sofa three days later. In the end, they solved the problem, and I was happy with their service.""",
143: """Hello, is this the management office of the Green Park apartment complex? My name is Minh, and I'm looking for an apartment to rent for my family. Could I ask you a few questions? First, do you have any two-bedroom apartments available right now? We're a family of three, and we'd like to move in next month. Second, how much is the rent per month, and what's included? Does it include water, electricity, and internet, or are those separate? Third, how long is the minimum contract? Is it six months or one year? And do I need to pay a deposit? Also, what facilities are there in the complex? Is there a parking area for motorbikes, a playground for kids, or a gym? Finally, would it be possible to visit an apartment this weekend? Thank you very much.""",
144: """Hello, is this the repair shop? My name is Minh. I just moved into a new house on Le Loi Street yesterday, and I found out that one of the windows in my bedroom is broken. The glass is cracked from top to bottom, and the window can't be closed properly. I need to get it fixed as soon as possible for a few reasons. First, the weather forecast says there's going to be heavy rain tonight, and I'm worried the water will come in and damage the floor and the furniture. Second, it's not safe, because the cracked glass could fall and hurt someone, especially my five-year-old daughter. And third, I'm worried about security, because anyone could open it from outside. Could you send someone to replace the window today? If not, could you at least cover it temporarily? Please call me back. Thank you.""",
145: """I remember breaking my wife's favorite vase about a year ago. It was a beautiful blue ceramic vase that her mother gave her as a wedding gift, and she kept it on a shelf in the living room. One Sunday, I was playing with my daughter in the living room, and we were throwing a soft ball to each other. I threw the ball a bit too high, and it hit the vase. It fell to the floor and broke into several pieces. I felt terrible, because I knew how much it meant to her. First, I cleaned up the pieces carefully so my daughter wouldn't get hurt. Then I collected the bigger pieces and looked up how to fix it online. I bought special glue and spent the whole evening putting it back together. It wasn't perfect, but my wife was touched that I tried so hard.""",
146: """Oh, you like eating at restaurants too? That's great. Can I ask you a few questions? First, what kind of food do you like the most? Do you prefer local food or international food, like Italian or Japanese? Second, is there a restaurant that you go to very often? What's special about it, and what do you usually order there? Also, who do you usually go with, your family or your friends? And one last question. What's the best restaurant you've ever been to? I'm always looking for new places to try, so maybe you could recommend one to me.""",
147: """Oh, congratulations on your new house! Can I ask you a few questions about it? First, where is your new house? Is it in the city or in the suburbs? Second, how big is it? How many bedrooms and bathrooms does it have? Also, why did you decide to move? Did you need more space, or did you want to live closer to work? And which room do you like the most in your new house? Finally, how are your new neighbors? Have you met any of them yet? I hope you're enjoying your new home.""",
148: """Oh, you like movies too? Then let me ask you a few questions about the movie you watched recently. First, what was the name of the movie, and what kind of movie was it? Was it an action movie, a comedy, or a drama? Second, where did you watch it? Did you go to the theater or watch it at home? Also, who did you watch it with? And what did you think of the movie? Did you like the story and the actors? Finally, would you recommend it to me? I'm looking for a good movie to watch this weekend.""",
149: """Oh, I love shopping too. Can I ask you about your recent shopping trip? First, where did you go shopping? Was it a shopping mall, a market, or did you shop online? Second, what did you buy? Was it clothes, electronics, or something else? Also, who did you go with? Did you go with your family or with friends? Did you find any good deals or discounts? And finally, how was the experience? Were you happy with what you bought? I'm planning to go shopping next weekend, so I'd love to get some tips from you.""",
}
